analyze.
fake-version-increase (like turn gem to 1.0.0): cond: no-bump(in git), no-tag, no-pushlish-rubygems
force-change-version-required: context: source, val:[true/false]
prefix: context: git/tag - prefix for current tag: examp: v for v@tag, branch/v for branch/v@tag, :nil for @tag
flow: context: repo, values:
- gear: spec in .gear
- geared_srpm: spec in .gear, code in <name>
- srpm: spec in root, code in <name>
- plain: spec in root, code in tag


tag:
- generate:
 - on release:
 - after bump: like gem-gettext
- prefix: ()\v\(etc)


